    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "NORTHWEST\nORIENT\nSystem Timetable Effective April 29, 1979",
      "NORTHWEST\nORIENT\nSystem Timetable Effective April 29, 1979\nMAY 1979\nSu Mo Tu We Th Fr Sa\n13\n20\n27\n7\n14\n21\n28\n1 2 3 4 5\n8\n9\n10 11 12\n15 16 17 18 19\n22 23 24 25 26\n29\n30 31\nJUNE 1979\nSu Mo Tu We Th Fr Sa\n3\n4\n5\n7\n10\n11\n12\n13 14\n17 18\n19\n20 21\n24 25 26 27 28\n1\n8\n15\n22\n29\n2\n9\n16\n23\n30\nNorthwest\nwon't put the\nSOUEEZE\non you.\nMost airlines are squeezing an extra seat into every\nCoach and Economy row on their wide-cabin jets. But\nnot Northwest. We give you wider seats, wider\narmrests, more comfort all around. A good reason to\nfly across the U.S.A., Canada, the Orient and Europe\non the roomy wide-cabin airline Northwest!\n2008.108.501",
      "Fairbanks\nAnchorage\nHóng Kong\nManil\nBeigen\nOslo\n• Gotebora\nEdmonton\nWinnipeg\nStavanger\nStockholm\nCopenhagen\n/ Amsterdam\nLondon\nSeattle\nMinneapolis-\nSt. Paul\nI Milwauker\nPortland\nBosto\nDetroit:\nCleveland:\nTokyo\nChicago\nsaka\nvew York\nPittsburgh\nPhiladelphia\nWashington Do.\nSan Francisco\nOkinawa\n• Las Vegas\nAtlanta\nMananasse\nHonolulu\nLos Angeles\nBan Diege\nопоеліх\nHouston\nNew Orl\n•Guam\nNORTHWEST ORIENT\nAUTHORIZED ROUTES\nNew Transpacific Service\nStarting July 2,\nnon-stop service between\nSEATTLE/TACOMA AND SEOUL\nHONOLULU AND OSAKA\n*Subject to government approval\nCheck out Northwest's world of service.\nThe fastest way\nbetween the U.S.A.\nand Tokyo.\nTake off via our exclusive nonstops\nbetween Chicago or Seattle/\nTacoma and Tokyo; the fastest\nway from many U.S. cities coast-to-\ncoast to the Orient.\nINDEX\nQuick Reference Schedules.\nDomestic Cargo Services.......\nPacific Passenger \u0026 Cargo Services...\n19 new routes,\n3 new cities\nin the U.S.A.\nWe're growing to get you going\nbetter than ever before. With\n19 new routes and three new\ncities-St. Louis, Las Vegas\nand sunny Orlando!\nPage\n2-30\n31\n32\nAtlantic Passenger \u0026 Cargo Services.\nFlight Itineraries..........\nAlaska, Hawaii \u0026 International Fares\nNew way between\nthe U.S.A.\nand Europe.\nOnly Northwest offers convenient\none-airline service from many U.S.\ncities coast to coast to Copenhagen,\nStockholm, Glasgow. And we fly the\nroomiest 747s going!\nPage\n33\n34-35\n36\nGeneral Information.....\nReservations Telephone Numbers...\nTicket Offices \u0026 Ground Services...\nPage\n37\n38\n39"
    ],
